spans.s:
प्र-√ जन् Ā. -जायते (ep. also P. ˚ति), to be born or produced, spring up from (abl.) be begotten (by [instr. or abl.]; from [abl.]; or with [loc.]; in [loc. or अधि]), RV. &c. &c.;
to become an embryo, ŚBr.;
to be born again, MBh.;
to propagate offspring with or by (instr.), RV.; ŚBr.; Mn.;
to bring forth, generate, bear, procreate (acc.);
 beget on (loc. or instr.), MBh.;
to cause to be reproduced, ŚBr. :
Caus. -जनयति, to cause any one (acc.)
to propagate offspring (instr.), RV.;
to beget, procreate, MaitrS. (aor. प्रजनयाम् अकः; cf. Pāṇ. iii, 1, 42), AV.; ŚBr.;
to cause to be reproduced, ŚBr. :
Desid. -जिजनिषते, to wish to be born, ŚBr. :
Desid. of Caus. -जिजनयिषति, to wish to cause to be conceived or born, ib.

प्र-√ जागृ P. -जागर्ति, to watch, watch over (loc.), Bhaṭṭ.;
to lie in wait for (gen.), MBh. :
Caus. -जागरयति (aor. -अजीगः), to wake (trans.), RV.

प्र-√ ज्ञा P. -जानाति, to know, understand (esp. a way or mode of action), discern, distinguish, know about, be acquainted with (acc.), RV. &c. &c.;
to find out, discover, perceive, learn, MBh.; Kāv. &c.:
Caus. -ज्ञापयति or -ज्ञपयति, to show or point out (the way), ŚBr.;
to summon, invite, Lalit.

प्र-√ ज्वल् P. -ज्वलति (ep. also Ā. ˚ते), to begin to burn or blaze, be kindled (lit. and fig.), flame or flash up, shine, gleam, TBr.; ChUp.; MBh. &c.:
Caus. -ज्वालयति or -ज्वलयति, to set on fire, light, kindle, inflame, GṛŚrS.; ChUp.; MBh. &c.;
 (with, Buddh.) to illustrate, explain, Divyāv.
